{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_81_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_81","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春，王正月，宋公、曹伯、衞人、邾人伐齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_81_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_81","textTraditional":"非伐喪也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_81_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_81","textTraditional":"二、夏，師救齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_81_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_81","textTraditional":"善救齊也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_81_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_81","textTraditional":"三、五月，戊寅，宋師及齊師戰於甗，齊師敗績。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_81_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_81","textTraditional":"戰不言伐，客不言及，言及，惡宋也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_81_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_81","textTraditional":"四、狄救齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_81_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_81","textTraditional":"善救齊也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_81_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_81","textTraditional":"五、秋，八月，丁亥，葬齊桓公。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_81_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_81","textTraditional":"六、冬，邢人、狄人伐衞。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_81_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_81","textTraditional":"狄其稱人何也？善累而後進之。伐衞所以救齊也。功近而德遠矣。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}